  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Deviant_Hurler.jpg\" title=\"Deviant Hurler\"><img alt=\"Deviant Hurler\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"217\" src=\"/images/Deviant_Hurler.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Deviant_Hurler.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Deviant Hurler</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b>  Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p><p>Similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Mutant Pukers</a> these creatures appear to be mostly upper torso, and walk on their hands.  Their arms and shoulders are heavily muscled as they need to be able to support the massive chainsaw attachment that is grafted to their chins.\n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> <i>Big and ugly as they are, they are not very durable.  A concerted attack will destroy them with a few blows, or a couple of spells.</i>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deviant Hurler\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Storerooms</a>  off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frosty Ranged Cannonier\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GG] Launcher\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Haxhaxor Libratorium</a>  and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Good Griefers Climate-Controlled Gymnasium</a> off <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
